    "body": "Progress and a re-scope. The **readers** are done on issue/586-app-stock-seam (gating): `prior_top`, `revolved_surface`, `columns_reach` and `carried_body_bounds` now read through `Columns`, and the answers are unchanged.\n\nThe **holders** can't move as a seam: they are the carried `Body` (sim `carry.rs`), a two-sided column store with lattice flips and mirrors that the app mutates (`simulate(&mut body.dex)`, `lower`). Putting that on the field engine is a data-model design, filed as **#637**. This PR will be `Refs #586`, and #586 closes when #637 lands.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
